  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Guild Harwich Artists</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3455 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-education category-news tag-guild-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3455\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/submitting-articles-for-website-publication/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Submitting Articles for Website Publication</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-01-08T00:49:27-05:00\" title=\"Monday, January 8, 2018, 12:49 am\">January 8, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists invites its members to submit photos, events, and articles to be considered for publication on The Guild of Harwich Artists website. We love to promote <a href=\"/news/submitting-articles-for-website-publication/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3391 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-education category-events category-monthly-meetings category-news tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-cape-cod-artist tag-guild-harwich-artists tag-harwich-chamber-of-commerce tag-monthly-meetings tag-peter-kalill\" id=\"post-3391\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/january-demonstrator-peter-kalill/\" rel=\"bookmark\">January Demonstrator, Peter Kalill</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-01-02T00:55:35-05:00\" title=\"Tuesday, January 2, 2018, 12:55 am\">January 2, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Peter Kalill will demonstrate his oil painting technique for the Guild of Harwich Artists at their January meeting.  The meeting will be held Saturday, January 20, 2018, at 2:00p.m. at <a href=\"/news/january-demonstrator-peter-kalill/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n",
